    "en": {
      "trackName": "WatchWizardRPG",
      "description": "WatchWizardRPG is a text-based idle RPG made entirely for your Apple Watch. Relax and watch your wizard grow, casting spells, collecting treasures, and exploring magical realms—all with just a few taps when you have a moment to spare.\n\nThis is a premium game, made with care by me, Aleks, a solo indie developer. No in-app purchases, no ads, no hidden costs—just a complete experience with a beginning, middle, and end.\n\nFeatures:\n\t•\tIdle Gameplay: Your wizard grows stronger even when you’re not playing. Perfect for quick moments of fun during your day.\n\t•\tRelaxing Progression: Tap to cast spells, level up, and uncover treasures while your story unfolds.\n\t•\tPremium, Old-School Charm: A one-time purchase gives you the full game—no interruptions, no gimmicks.\n\t•\tDesigned for Apple Watch: Simple, engaging gameplay in a world of magic, right on your wrist.\n\nWhether you’re waiting in line, taking a break, or just looking for a little escape, WatchWizardRPG brings a bit of magic to your day.\n\nSupport indie development and enjoy an idle RPG built with passion and simplicity.",
